Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(relay): add hardcoded billing header filter for
 Claude Code

- Strip x-anthropic-billing-header from all JSON string fields
- Only matches strings that START with the header (no false positives)
- Regex: x-anthropic-billing-header:.*?cch=[^;]*;?
- Logs info when header stripped, info if still present after (unexpected)
- Applies to ALL channels, cannot be disabled from admin panel
- Execution order: RemoveDisabledFields -> ApplyBuiltinOverride -> ApplyParamOverrideWithRelayInfo
